<div class="hero" id="home">
  <h1>D. Michael Brown</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">~ Journey to PhD ~</p>
  <p class="tagline">From forty-three years of working life to clinical psychology. The climb is the point. The destination is bilingual psycho-oncology in Short Hills, New Jersey.</p>
  <p class="meta">Newton, NJ → Short Hills, NJ · One mile at a time.</p>
